  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">요즘 과학고, 영재학교에서 물리를 좋아하는 아이들(소위 &quot;물리 덕후&quot;)은 입자물리, 우주론 등 고등한 수학이 많이 필요한 &quot;낭만 있어 보이는&quot; 분야와 고체, 응집물질물리 등 창발적, 응용적이고 다른 과학 분야(화학, 전자공학, 재료공학 등)와 간학문적인 성격이 강한 분야 중 어느 것을 더 좋아하나요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/227231144e86fbe181a30b3b027c6a5370ba09db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/227231144e86fbe181a30b3b027c6a5370ba09db\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"476\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7bab0b2fceef9339ea430bdb48b3668796d330d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7bab0b2fceef9339ea430bdb48b3668796d330d\" data-origin-width=\"1023\" data-origin-height=\"767\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7acb8961949cd855de2bc8c7be3bd71dc045005\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e7acb8961949cd855de2bc8c7be3bd71dc045005\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">웃으시라고 짤 조금 올리고 갑니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
